{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01UyX8mnZBRFsKd12Hh7N2Gm", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.thaipbs.or.th/program/Tuktid/watch/103114\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269548/181355/1108546\"}, {\"url\": \"https://library.payap.ac.th/webin/ntic/web_NTIC_article_2554/content/content/54001.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269547/181354/1108542\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so01.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/ajnu/article/download/131429/159380/786848\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269546/181353/1108538\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269558/181357/1108564\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269561/181356/1108560\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thaipbs.or.th/news/content/255677\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:19:48.408Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "ซิ่นตีนจก \"ข้าวหลามตัด\" ลายขนาดใหญ่ เรียกว่า \"ลายผักกูด\" OR \"ลายหงส์\" OR \"ลายเครือเถา\" OR \"ลายขอ\" ตีนจก ราชบุรี ลาวครั่ง ไทยวน", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01PnBDVybB55hkGLrejz6LEj", "content": [{"title": "www.thaipbs.or.th", "url": "https://www.thaipbs.or.th/program/Tuktid/watch/103114"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269548/181355/1108546"}, {"title": "library.payap.ac.th", "url": "https://library.payap.ac.th/webin/ntic/web_NTIC_article_2554/content/content/54001.pdf"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269547/181354/1108542"}, {"title": "so01.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so01.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/ajnu/article/download/131429/159380/786848"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269546/181353/1108538"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269558/181357/1108564"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/JPR/article/download/269561/181356/1108560"}, {"title": "สืบสาน \"ผ้าจกคูบัว\" มรดกชุมชนไทยวนในราชบุรี", "url": "https://www.thaipbs.or.th/news/content/255677"}]}, "The search didn't find a source that matches your specific question. None of the results mention a \"ข้าวหลามตัด\" (diamond) pattern, and none name ลายผักกูด, ลายหงส์, or ลายเครือเถา as large-scale designs on ตีนจก. Those terms may come from other sources or may not be standard names.\n\nWhat the results do cover:\n\n- **Ratchaburi Tai-Yuan style:** One article describes ลายผ้าตีนจกมี 9 ลาย, including ดอกเซีย, กาบ, หน้าหมอน, โก้งเก้ง, and หักนกคู่. It does not list any diamond or ผักกูด pattern.\n- **Khu Bua, Ratchaburi:** A different article notes that ผ้าซิ่นตีนจกคูบัวจะพบมากใน ตำบลคูบัว อำเภอเมือง จังหวัดราชบุรี, where the weaving uses a plain-background style with few motifs. A Thai PBS report also mentions a newer pattern based on the แคทราย plant.\n- **Lao Khrang (Suphan Buri):** One paper lists motifs such as ระฆัง, ปู, ดอกแก้ว, ขอ, and ผีเสื้อ, with การผสมเทคนิคขิด จกและมัดหมี on a red ground. \"ขอ\" appears here as a motif name, but the source doesn't describe its size or shape.\n- **General description:** A Northern Thai encyclopedia entry says ส่วนล่างสุดของซิ่นคือตีนสิ้น, which is the bottom border where the จก (supplementary weft) work is concentrated.\n\nTo confirm the diamond-pattern names, you would need a specialized source on Tai-Yuan or Lao Khrang textile motifs, such as a museum catalogue or a Thai textile encyclopedia."], "durationSeconds": 7.363697375000004, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01UyX8mnZBRFsKd12Hh7N2Gm", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
